msgctxt "112"
msgid "(...Uh-oh.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "(There aren't any foxtails here. What now?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san. What're you poking around over there for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Foxtails, actually. I thought I'd seen some around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Ah, the elusive foxtail. I like to refer to them by their\r\n"
"scientific name: <Italic>Setaria viridis</Italic>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "That's, uh... a bit of a mouthful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"It's a beautiful plant, though. The name foxtail is such\r\n"
"an apt description of its bushy spikes, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Uh, sure. Anyway, I didn't find any."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Well, of course not. Not this time of year, at least. You see,\r\n"
"it has to do with the fluffy tail-like spikes at the end of\r\n"
"the stem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"While the plant itself grows all year round, the spikes\r\n"
"only grow in during the summer and autumn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"So, I'm afraid you're out of luck, Kiryu-san. Mind if I ask\r\n"
"what you want them for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Well, I actually wanted a cat toy, but there aren't any pet\r\n"
"shops around. Figured a foxtail was a fine second choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Then it's good you didn't find one. They're awful for pets.\r\n"
"As for cat toys... I may have a spare one I can give you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "That would be great. I only need to borrow it, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"No, no. I insist you take it. My wife's obsession with cats\r\n"
"has brought more toys than I know what to humanly do with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Huh. Well, thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Just wait here a moment. I'll go get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "Ok."

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Sorry to keep you waiting. Here."
msgstr "Mi scusi per l'attesa. Ehm..."

msgctxt "400"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Green Cat Toy<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Thanks for this, Miyara-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Ah, it's nothing. I hope your cat enjoys it. By the way,\r\n"
"did you know there's another species called a dog's tail?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "I suppose one man's fox is another man's dog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "There's even another one... The cat's tail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr "Interessante."

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Isn't it? Given my wife's penchant for all things feline, it\r\n"
"should be no surprise that our house is full of cat's tails."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "By which I of course mean both plant and animal! Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

